.TH rune-term-ctl 1
.SH NAME
\fBrune\-term\-ctl\fR \- Control and inspect rune\-term (profiles, tabs, runtime state).
.SH SYNOPSIS
rune\-term\-ctl [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Control and inspect rune\-term (profiles, tabs, runtime state).
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
\fBinfo\fR
Print basic CLI/protocol information.
.TP
\fBprofiles\fR
Inspect configured profiles.
.TP
\fBtabs\fR
Inspect live tabs/panes (requires a running rune\-term control endpoint).
.TP
\fBhandover\fR
Flip the running instance\*(Aqs handover on: its exit hands its shells to keepers.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output machine\-readable JSON.
.TP
\fB\-\-socket\fR\fI <PATH>\fR
Path to the control socket.
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V, \-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0
